{"id":"3676ade4165c293c","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-poset.md","title":"Partially Ordered Set","display":"df-poset — Partially Ordered Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-poset","aliases":["93-df-poset"],"display":"df-poset — Partially Ordered Set","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-poset — Partially Ordered Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R\">\\(P,R\\)</span> 为集合候选；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\)</span> 保留原引用的二元谓词接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(P)\\land R\\subseteq P^2\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(P)\\land R\\subseteq P^2\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许空偏序集；没有向 Dedekind–MacNeille 完备化额外加入非空性假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Set}_{93}$ 来自 [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(P)\\land R\\subseteq P^2\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to x=y)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in P\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":939,"backlinks":[{"id":"053b08137256a80a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)$ is the partial-order predicate of [[93-df-poset]]."}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}